      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode ended with the patient having a concrete plan: wait for notification, keep phone on, re-contact if no news in two weeks, retain thoracic surgery appointment, and know emergency triggers. The doctor obtained clear patient acknowledgement and a teach-back of the plan.",
